# 10) Recommended conflict resolution

A simple approach:

- each record has `updatedAt`
- server stores `updatedAt` too
- on sync:
  - if local `updatedAt > server.updatedAt`, push local
  - if server `updatedAt > local.updatedAt`, pull server
  - if both changed, mark conflict and ask user

