# 6) Sync strategy explained

## Local-first
When the user saves a survey:
- write to SQLite immediately
- mark as pending sync

## Reconnect sync
When network changes to online:
- fetch all pending records
- POST them to server
- mark each as synced locally

## Why this is minimal
This avoids:
- complex conflict resolution
- background task scheduling
- auth
- file uploads
- partial merges

