# 5) How monetization works in this MVP

This version uses **Stripe Checkout** to sell **100 coins**.

You can extend it to:
- unlock premium messaging features
- allow paid boosts
- sell subscriptions
- remove ads
- enable custom themes / badges

### Example premium logic
When sending a boosted message:
- check if user has at least 1 coin
- deduct 1 coin
- mark message as boosted
- display boosted messages with a star

You can add this to `sendMessage`:

```js
if (boosted) {
  const user = await db.get(`SELECT coins FROM users WHERE id = ?`, [socket.user.id]);
  if (user.coins < 1) return;
  await db.run(`UPDATE users SET coins = coins - 1 WHERE id = ?`, [socket.user.id]);
}
```

