---

## What this dashboard does

### Real-time visualization
- Generates a new random value every second
- Updates the chart dynamically
- Shows:
  - current value
  - average value
  - number of updates

### Form handling
- User can enter:
  - name
  - threshold
  - display mode
  - notes
- On submit, settings are saved and logged

### Controls
- Pause/resume live feed
- Reset data
- Switch chart type between line and bar

