```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Stock Price Heatmap</title>
  <style>
    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1020;
