Save as `index.html` and open in a browser:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Stock Price Heatmap</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/d3@7"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b1020;
      --panel: #121a33;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
