## 4) How real-time collaboration works

- Each client connects to the Socket.IO server.
- When a user creates/moves/deletes/edits a task, the client emits an event.
- The server updates the shared board state.
- The server broadcasts `board:update` to all connected clients.
- All clients re-render with the latest state.

This gives you live collaborative behavior with minimal code.

