# 5) Notes on current limitations

This is a good initial foundation, but it still needs a few improvements:

- Drag-and-drop currently updates task status by dropping on a column, but doesn’t yet support reordering within a column
- No authentication or user accounts
- No persistent database; state is in memory and resets on server restart
- No optimistic UI conflict resolution
- No task editing form yet, only create/delete and status changes

