# 5) How it works

## Drag-and-drop
- Tasks are draggable HTML elements.
- Dropping a task on a column emits:

```ts
socket.emit("task:move", { id, status });
```

- Server updates the task and broadcasts the full board state to all connected clients.

## Real-time collaboration
- Every client listens for:

```ts
socket.on("board:updated", ...)
```

- When one user changes a task, all clients immediately refresh.

