    @Override
    public Order onMarketData(MarketDataEvent event) {
        Double prev = lastPriceBySymbol.put(event.symbol, event.last);
        if (prev == null) return null;

        double diff = event.last - prev;
        if (diff > 0.05) {
            return new Order(event.symbol, OrderSide.BUY, OrderType.MARKET, 100);
        } else if (diff < -0.05) {
            return new Order(event.symbol, OrderSide.SELL, OrderType.MARKET, 100);
        }
        return null;
    }
}
```

> For real low-latency systems, replace `HashMap` with a symbol-indexed array or primitive map to avoid allocations and contention.

