## 5) Important limitations of this minimal version

This version is **not yet truly millions/sec capable** because it uses:
- per-message TCP reads
- `time.Now()` on the hot path
- channel sends per message
- allocations in encoding
- no batching on network or routing
- no backpressure strategy

