## 7) Minimal latency histogram

If you want percentiles, use a histogram. Minimal sketch:

```go
type Histogram struct {
	buckets [64]uint64
}

func (h *Histogram) Observe(ns uint64) {
	idx := 0
	for ns > 0 && idx < 63 {
		ns >>= 1
		idx++
	}
	atomic.AddUint64(&h.buckets[idx], 1)
}
```

This gives you rough latency distribution quickly.

