## If you want bidirectional flow aggregation

You can canonicalize the 5-tuple before hashing:

```cpp
static inline FlowKey canonicalize(const FlowKey& k) noexcept {
    FlowKey out = k;

    bool swap = false;
    if (out.src_ip > out.dst_ip) swap = true;
    else if (out.src_ip == out.dst_ip && out.src_port > out.dst_port) swap = true;

    if (swap) {
        std::swap(out.src_ip, out.dst_ip);
        std::swap(out.src_port, out.dst_port);
    }
    return out;
}
```

Then call `canonicalize()` in `ingest()`.

