## Safer and faster hashing replacement

Here is a better hash function using `maphash`:

```go
import "hash/maphash"

var seed = maphash.MakeSeed()

func hashFlowKey(k FlowKey) uint64 {
	var h maphash.Hash
	h.SetSeed(seed)
	h.Write(k.SrcIP[:])
	h.Write(k.DstIP[:])

	var buf [5]byte
	buf[0] = byte(k.SrcPort >> 8)
	buf[1] = byte(k.SrcPort)
	buf[2] = byte(k.DstPort >> 8)
	buf[3] = byte(k.DstPort)
	buf[4] = k.Proto
	h.Write(buf[:])

	return h.Sum64()
}
```

Then:

```go
func (a *Analyzer) shardFor(key FlowKey) *Shard {
	h := hashFlowKey(key)
	return &a.shards[uint32(h)&a.shardMask]
}
```

