## What it does
- Accepts 3-axis accelerometer samples
- Maintains a sliding window
- Computes simple features:
  - mean magnitude
  - RMS magnitude
  - variance
  - peak-to-peak magnitude
- Flags an anomaly when features exceed learned baseline thresholds

This is a good starting point for:
- vibration monitoring
- motion fault detection
- shock detection
- basic condition monitoring

