## 10) Fixed timestep version of `Tick`

If you want more stable physics, use an accumulator:

```cpp
class CustomPhysicsPlugin
{
public:
    bool Initialize();
    void Shutdown();
    void Tick(float deltaTime);

private:
    PhysicsWorld m_world;
    bool m_initialized = false;
    float m_accumulator = 0.0f;
    const float m_fixedDt = 1.0f / 60.0f;
};
```

```cpp
void CustomPhysicsPlugin::Tick(float deltaTime)
{
    if (!m_initialized)
        return;

    m_accumulator += deltaTime;
    while (m_accumulator >= m_fixedDt)
    {
        m_world.Step(m_fixedDt);
        m_accumulator -= m_fixedDt;
    }
}
```

